==Trivia==
*In spite of being listed sixth in the [[Treasure]] menu, the Void Fruit is actually the seventh obtainable Into the Future Treasure.
*The Void Fruit originally only improved the Weaken effect's duration by 10% and the Knockback effect's distance by 20%. This was changed at an unknown date.
*The Void Fruit, like other fruits is based on a real-life fruit, these being grapes.
